---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="UX Architect — UX Design Strategies for the AI Era" description="Expert UX design strategies, processes & tools for the age of AI. Practical tips for designers adapting to AI-powered workflows.">

<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="reveal">
    UX Design in the <span class="accent">Age of AI</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="hero-desc reveal reveal-delay-1">
    Practical strategies, processes & tools for UX designers navigating the AI revolution. Build better experiences with AI — not against it.
  </p>
  <a href="/blog" class="btn btn-primary reveal reveal-delay-2">
    Read Articles
  </a>
</section>

<section class="section" id="latest">
  <div class="section-header reveal">
    <span class="section-label">Latest Articles</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">What's New</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Deep dives on AI-powered UX design, processes, and tools.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card reveal reveal-delay-1">
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="card-tag">AI UX</span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>5 min read</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">The AI UX Design Process: How to Design for AI-Powered Features</h3>
        <p class="card-excerpt">AI features change everything about the UX design process. Here's the new framework that every UX designer needs to understand.</p>
        <a href="/blog/ai-ux-design-process" class="card-link">Read Article</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card reveal reveal-delay-2">
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="card-tag">Process</span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>4 min read</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">7 UX Processes That AI Can Automate (And Which Ones It Can't)</h3>
        <p class="card-excerpt">Not all UX processes are created equal. Learn which ones AI can speed up and which still require a human designer.</p>
        <a href="/blog/ux-processes-ai-automate" class="card-link">Read Article</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card reveal reveal-delay-3">
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="card-tag">Tools</span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>6 min read</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">UX Designer's Guide to AI Tools in 2025</h3>
        <p class="card-excerpt">The AI tool landscape for UX designers is growing fast. Here's what's worth your time and what to skip.</p>
        <a href="/blog/ai-tools-ux-designers-2025" class="card-link">Read Article</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="section-header reveal">
    <span class="section-label">About</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Why UX Architect?</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">UX design is changing faster than ever. AI is reshaping every part of the design process — from research to prototyping to testing.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="reveal" style="max-width: 720px;">
    <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
      This site is built for designers who want to stay ahead of the curve. We write about the intersection of UX and AI — how to design for AI-powered features, how to use AI in your design process, and how to build products that feel both intelligent and human.
    </p>
    <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
      Every article is grounded in real experience. No fluff, no theory. Just actionable strategies that you can use tomorrow.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
